#: include/global_settings.php:2217
msgid ""
"What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in "
"any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Vilken detaljnivå ska skickas till loggfilen? VARNING: Om du använder någon "
"annan nivå än INGEN eller LÅG kan diskutrymmet snabbt ta slut."

#: include/global_settings.php:2262
msgid ""
"For either core Cacti Services or Plugins that require internet access, "
"enter the proxy server and port here in the following format IP:PORT.  For "
"example 192.168.1.1:8080."
msgstr ""
"För Cactis kärntjänster eller insticksmoduler som behöver internetåtkomst "
"anger du proxyservern och porten i formatet IP:PORT. Till exempel: "
"192.168.1.1:8080."
